<title>USA: Danka business names Snell COO.</title>
<headline>Danka business names Snell COO.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Fla 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danka Business Systems PLC said Monday that David Snell, its chief financial officer, had been promoted to chief operating officer.  </p>
<p>The company said Snell's promotion would take effect October 1.</p>
<p>A company spokeswoman said chief operating officer was a new position within Danka, a supplier of automated office equipment.</p>
<p>Snell was chief financial officer since 1988, the company said.</p>
</text>
